{"name": "The King Of Beasts", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies to evolve into enemy form. Players will control mutated creatures with this ability, constantly fighting against other mutated creatures to evolve into more powerful creatures. They will survive in terrifying alien experiments and become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolutionary freedom, as long as you kill enemies, you can evolve into enemy form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/e2304af8edab97b47baaaeb6cfb156c8.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/e2304af8edab97b47baaaeb6cfb156c8.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perilous dangers lurk in the alien experimental field, and players need to remain vigilant at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/c9a9ef2aea1c19c93e0d4d0cd1a1ecf4.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/c9a9ef2aea1c19c93e0d4d0cd1a1ecf4.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive experience, a grand and unique alien experimental field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/0c70ca054a4093ea6e53223038b0e4aa.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/0c70ca054a4093ea6e53223038b0e4aa.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse in characteristics, mutated creatures possess unique abilities to extract and combine different traits to create a one-of-a-kind king of exotic beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/a6c489f9001e05a731ffb931279bb838.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/a6c489f9001e05a731ffb931279bb838.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting wits and courage, directly challenging powerful mutant creatures is not the best way. It requires the reasonable use of experimental field mechanisms and other mutant creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/1545e31a69005c680405473e812e9b80.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/1545e31a69005c680405473e812e9b80.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time limited survival, as time goes by, more and more powerful experimental subjects will join the battle and survive until the end to become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras_big/79ef70d535502eea62322a6daf5388d6.avif?t=1756684571\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/extras/79ef70d535502eea62322a6daf5388d6.avif?t=1756684571\" width=\"800\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kill enemies to evolve into enemy form. Players will control mutated creatures with this ability, constantly fighting against other mutated creatures to evolve into more powerful creatures. They will survive in terrifying alien experiments and become the king of beasts.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284860/header.jpg?t=1756684571", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Villain Protagonist", "Action", "Horror", "Indie", "Hack and Slash", "Open World"], "developers": "upmupm420", "publishers": "upmupm420", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3284860", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "27 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/qSFLQRwvKfc", "first_seen": 1748296800.0, "review_rank": 1642}